<view class="tools-page">
  <view class="tools-header">
    <view class="tools-title-row">
      <view>
        <view class="tools-title">日常工具</view>
        <view class="tools-subtitle">控糖参考和记录辅助。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tools-badge">1 个</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tool-card" bindtap="goFood">
    <view class="tool-icon">
      <image class="tool-icon-image" src="/assets/lucide/png/soup-green.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
    <view class="tool-content">
      <view class="tool-title">食物</view>
      <view class="tool-desc">查看控糖饮食参考，随机来一份日常食谱。</view>
      <view class="tool-tags">
        <text>食物清单</text>
        <text>随机食谱</text>
        <text>日常参考</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <image class="tool-arrow" src="/assets/lucide/png/chevron-right-green.png" mode="aspectFit" />
  </view>

  <view class="tools-notice">
    饮食建议仅供记录和日常参考，不能替代医生或营养师建议。
  </view>
</view>
